.TH "PACE GOAL" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace goal Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-goal \- User goals and personal records.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace goal
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
User goals and personal records.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBlist\fP
  List configured goals.
  See \fBpace goal-list(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBlist\fP command.
.PP
\fBpersonal-records\fP
  Personal records across activity types.
  See \fBpace goal-personal-records(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBpersonal-records\fP command.
